#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:770
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Nama (cth. Ibu)"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:813
msgid ""
"This is the base hardware volume applied to the selected output when a call "
"connects. The volume buttons during a call only adjust fine-tuning on top of "
"this base level, so if the base is 0% the call stays silent no matter what. "
"Values above 100% use software amplification and may distort audio. Wired "
"Headset and Bluetooth levels are stored for upcoming routing support."
msgstr "Ini ialah kelantangan perkakasan asas yang digunakan pada output yang dipilih apabila panggilan disambungkan. Butang kelantangan semasa panggilan hanya melaraskan penalaan halus di atas tahap asas ini, jadi jika asasnya 0%, panggilan kekal senyap walau apa pun. Nilai melebihi 100% menggunakan amplifikasi perisian dan mungkin menyebabkan audio herot. Tahap Set kepala berwayar dan Bluetooth disimpan untuk sokongan penghalaan akan datang."

